**What did you expect to happen:**
We need to ensure the local path specified on PV matches the path on node agent daemonset. Currently we install a single node agent daemonset which requires the local path to be the same across node groups, we might need to consider installing the daemonset per node group and having local model controller to create the daemonset and get the local path from PV.

